## 5. Disambiguation against git-prune(1)

MANWIDTH=100 man -P cat git-prune, lines 24-25:
      -n, --dry-run
          Do not remove anything; just report what it would remove.
git-prune(1) omits the words "With prune,". The registered span therefore resolves
uniquely to git-worktree(1) OPTIONS `-n, --dry-run`, not to git-prune(1).

